        },
        {
          "text": "Imwe eighanga eriziramu nsoni mwenenie era mweireku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nga mukaali kufuuyibwa ere na mpewo ng'oti bikaba. Mwenenie ng'obusungu bwa Musengwa Katonda obwokya ng'oti muliro bukaali kubaidhaku, era ng'olunaku lw'aja okulagiraku ekiruyi kye lukaali kutuuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imwe abantu ab'ensi eno abeesigwa eri Musengwa Katonda era abagondera ebiragiro bye, mukole ebyo ebituufu era muteekuluntaza mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda. Oba katyo mwakawona ekibonerezo ku lunaku Musengwa Katonda lw'aja okulagiraku obusungu bwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
