        {
          "text": "Ekibuga Gaza kija kulekebwa agho kyereere, n'ekibuga Ashikeloni kyona kija kuwolongera. Abantu ab'omu kibuga Ashidodi baja kubingibwamu mu kitundu butundu kya lunaku. N'ekibuga Ekuroni kija kuzikirizibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
